    <briefdescription>
<para>Trait to indicate whether a type&apos;s bits can be hashed directly. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A type trait which is true if we want to combine values for hashing by reading the underlying data. It is false if values of this type must first be passed to hash_value, and the resulting hash_codes combined. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
